    {
      "id": "9a77805c90f685ffd8e05ae12dddd6146c0d4a219d59576c2d26d82a7eefd73f",
      "text": "Clearing",
      "hash": "06648760a765043c7be785f4e63ebea0fd0dcd056d36d53d153208749e757840"
    },
    {
      "id": "060828f14f3fb34ed047fb8f956d3d68ebb8d23df76ca1c40aa847b9924a820a",
      "text": "Ending the current session and starting a fresh one. The next message begins with an empty session and an empty context window.",
      "hash": "eb7562c076bbf2b51e0ca0a99e0ea61566cb50f86d60a4805b95e26bba86d511"
    },
    {
      "id": "09353e8493af9022cac1ba9022f10049d82e1ea5f0be4a0d9a3ac1612f75d0ff",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "9764fd25daf8f8ecabc125244bf737ee1d917bc4b49491d4c8634cb1e8c416da",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "29e5e5cd33be1486540f9d050b2b0cd97b9f56e67878b06a61b7677405047abb",
      "text": "Ending the current",
      "hash": "fe401eff5ce91b34ea7690d6e4f0044ee89e3a94fab0baed787d23bdc83b203a"
    },
    {
      "id": "bb02ee57c9d4cc627fdde31db13fcb55628ab00a0326cee14f8781b98b201f91",
      "text": "and starting a fresh one. The next message begins with an empty session and an empty",
      "hash": "3c61a61ee00c084e44a982e8784fa711d77f3748d72728755fd0e733df4797be"
    },
    {
      "id": "dfd9d6bc3d74df1d119e864e482f97080a7ea1cc1047a89a12152f83ab0fcfd6",
      "text": "context window",
      "hash": "6764434518d37f01df452fe2af0af3f314f8c27a72519001ea14189c5ee42476"
    },
    {
      "id": "e97265ae74579475c9acb12c55ebdc5cb094435f6c6dfa9c213cbe8e1409e97f",
      "text": ". Usually user-driven.",
      "hash": "62b0c322de256dbd6908a8ab5339cfa94e3553ddd4480515f676cf54e44ae3db"
    },
    {
      "id": "10f0b9ccb283049d78617b2d0d1d70758da8995bbbfe8e6b0a138be005f05f1b",
      "text": "Clearing is the cure for a polluted context. A session accumulates everything: failed attempts, wrong turns, stale",
      "hash": "934284f4da829068b7add2e49fa5e94bcde503587b7d52018871db52655c4fdd"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3fe2912d45da57924e4530c5d63b631b7258c8c1a8857f58fbd2e9db0171fa4",
      "text": "tool results",
      "hash": "a5594e12dfffd8e54c36d9b99bc31c7d41f0389d2251790338f34e836a3211fe"
    },
    {
      "id": "284128999b408e0c3f45530524aef0a3f615720983b1044abe43256c35a2a1de",
      "text": ", abandoned plans. The",
      "hash": "ebbc8bc64305794611a67005a0dd393feaea9dd4a8c4b2eda6709bd2eee442b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "920f8660c2802ddabefbab2e636ac67425dd82c32a63c5cf43e96e6e4614f939",
      "text": "re-reads all of it on every",
      "hash": "c01aab4fa1071d1f764e799ef151347fb5aeed3ac5d738012b82cea37bf344e0"
    },
    {
      "id": "60619b174d367a990624b10f978b8f6a1e2443a31352fc44db2c8eb3da49560a",
      "text": ", and bad history drags on new work. Deep into a long session the",
      "hash": "a406846932fecf47e0cb3a421c284943198767c713295631ba915e273f5bb68a"
    },
    {
      "id": "0c54d3544cd566c281f8239e9cb8749da69f95d13f543686e3fcffc7ef2aa755",
      "text": "gets vaguer and less obedient — instructions you gave clearly get ignored, quality slips, and prodding it to do better doesn't help, because the noise it's wading through is still in its",
      "hash": "91b9bd14b6d175d95fdc6e4189b5ead9ce40b0a31292cbd8432f429f040600d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "3f77d962f3ab7b4ac1be3a7286f46ebadb85978fb8967d72a23410ff6b52a4d7",
      "text": ". Clearing removes the noise.",
      "hash": "54b994224773eff5f20698a70ab2712385831e57576d2343ab88565b8f6b3ee6"
    },
    {
      "id": "2988e0ce32883d019ead0223e95a420fdf56e563b3ff45d757d9643923f1e58e",
      "text": "Clearing doesn't erase the conversation. Most",
      "hash": "e102f14ed985e424be03127f26a6f3a9cf822daca6092bfd48185fe72226da0b"
    },
    {
      "id": "052eeaa6a2ed992fb7b9ade37856919b00f78c7a1328e2700f181baa4d5e76af",
      "text": "keep session history on your computer, so the transcript is still there to read or resume. What's gone is the agent's working state: the model is",
      "hash": "ebef3a5a9e971bd1fb7f93cb26543cac21c317815ecf84a0050a65803a2fb5f8"
    },
    {
      "id": "6994d723b01eade1aba93ad4e1bf790973c016d964753546c000525915ea78c8",
      "text": ", so the new session knows nothing the old one knew. If the session holds decisions or progress the next one will need, have the agent write a",
      "hash": "a33bb23d6f387ba3dd0b525069ee97f90b0594e8203ef0d3007ac1b1125ca145"
    },
    {
      "id": "78490633fd3fe5236cd6acf6e941b2c4add98451c6cf0cd34eabd7b9984ace3e",
      "text": "handoff artifact",
      "hash": "741619a26b388b5e1035994e6e7ce6c59c885ebd231ad21f8d9ff02438a0cbc9"
    },
    {
      "id": "77a0b728f3d7466facaff9e120bb9113e2c02b01cf0681837aee2ec2b04ae829",
      "text": "first, then start the new session by pointing at it.",
      "hash": "bd21fc422bc14b8ac9daf95628a13f2baca37450509617dea74b14ef221c0413"
    },
    {
      "id": "a5a093e940f8430d50bce646c5d62280af465bf08186e8a02a7f05154023bf94",
      "text": "Compare",
      "hash": "e888155d8c7d2e3c3f9eb1bf57e8d81ba1a3c182b5e94b01e09de2cb2cca81f9"
    },
    {
      "id": "899c9ff2a68c074b85ac6e3f93ba928bd79829fd6d99ed89a850ab1ddd7d4e55",
      "text": ", which summarises the session into the new context instead of starting empty. Clearing is the blunter tool: nothing carries over, including the junk.",
      "hash": "0417c8b99b847d726977e0d2742a8d7b68709c09e370059df6c70a5ae4f1ea30"
    },
    {
      "id": "cfa5a6e566228e6a341e5fba61fdcfe6c02771ee67fec1361aadfe1c0d54cc29",
      "text": "Usage:",
      "hash": "2bad3eeaf33caffe3bc9b482b4934ed19eb4ec3614c12373e1a5c5f8948217da"
    },
    {
      "id": "2e7bb916119b6ac3a0ea25c24c731c2c281b2cf43d774dfbb1ffbfcfc4bfc701",
      "text": "\"It's stuck looping on the failing test.\"",
      "hash": "5ab8f7121be2de024c6d59aabb22e6bd5935c73f17ab8419bbe6cdb1118b8bcd"
    },
    {
      "id": "5f642ba4dd38630e64fcf38defad3b975fa617da554fd00f5df77e03b79aa933",
      "text": "\"Just clear it — start a fresh session with the plan doc and the test file. No point fighting the existing context.\"",
      "hash": "ad62e1ed97710889e060f8396fd3a983abf8d7d592442f436ff40b7191b98bfe"
    },
    {
      "id": "defdda1337ec02324023b50bdb6812e87cf00bc025819353b55d8e78381c6b6c",
      "text": "Previous term",
      "hash": "735604aff9e8f2192b83df4905cfc8e395613e0ce05f8ca85a1d2d1d44fd59f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "38b16a3194acfb6628cf58232027886b378a6bbc84529a871d453353585f9aea",
      "text": "Smart zone",
      "hash": "1d6692e2d3e60ff1a5113a02cc9524ca6a226f294b75c980767702844a9240ee"
    },
    {
